@startuml
title 新用户注册顺序图

actor User
participant RegisterUI
participant RegisterController
database UserDB
participant NotificationSystem

User -> RegisterUI : inputRegisterInfo(email/studentId, password)

RegisterUI -> RegisterController : validateRegisterInfo(info)

RegisterController -> UserDB : checkDuplicateAndValidity(info)

UserDB --> RegisterController : returnValidateResult(result)

alt 验证通过
    RegisterController -> UserDB : createUserAccount(info)
    UserDB -> UserDB : saveUserInfo(info)\n生成 userId
    UserDB --> RegisterController : returnCreateResult(userId)
    RegisterController -> NotificationSystem : sendActivationNotice(userId, email)
    NotificationSystem --> RegisterController : noticeStatus
    RegisterController -> RegisterUI : showRegisterResult(success, notice)
else 验证失败（重复 / 不合法）
    RegisterController -> RegisterUI : showRegisterResult(failure, reason)
end

RegisterUI --> User : 显示注册结果

@enduml
